      "title": "ieee80211: Support 16 bytes MIC in MME",
      "message": "ieee80211: Support 16 bytes MIC in MME\n\nThe MIC in Management MIC element can be 8 or 16 bytes depending on\nnegotiated cipher but current implementation assumes it's always 8\nbytes. Fix this.\n\nReference: IEEE 802.11-2020 9.4.2.54\n\nSigned-off-by: Chien Wong <m@xv97.com>\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit a446a0da9416d5af1c85d1a5d656bae70ccbcd2b)\n\nCo-authored-by: Chien Wong <m@xv97.com>",
